    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outside the KBS broadcasting centre in Seoul, a documentary cameraman stops rookie producer Baek Seung-chan as he sprints up the front steps on his first morning. Listen for the question word for 'why', and the word for the induction ceremony he is afraid of missing.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "camera_pd",
      "t": "KBS 신입사원이시죠?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "seungchan",
      "t": "아, 네.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "camera_pd",
      "t": "왜 뛰세요?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "seungchan",
      "t": "아, 저 입사식 하는데요.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "seungchan",
      "t": "늦은 거 같아가지고.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
